       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. VALIDATE-TRANSACTION.

DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.

01 LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE PIC X.
01 LK-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
01 LK-VALIDATION-STATUS PIC X.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE
    LK-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT
    LK-VALIDATION-STATUS.

    MOVE "N" TO LK-VALIDATION-STATUS

    IF (LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE = "C"
        OR LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE = "D")
        AND LK-TRANSACTION-AMOUNT > ZERO

        MOVE "Y" TO LK-VALIDATION-STATUS
    END-IF

    GOBACK.

END PROGRAM VALIDATE-TRANSACTION.
